#. module: pao_cr_gain_loss_tracker
#: model:mail.template,body_html:pao_cr_gain_loss_tracker.email_template_crm_gain_loss_tracker
msgid ""
"<p style=\"padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"                    <span>Hello ${object.partner_id.name},</span>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <span>Thank you for contacting us earlier today.</span>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <span>\n"
"                        As we discussed, I wanted to provide you with access to the documentation \n"
"                        related to the PrimusGFS audit. You can find the documents by following the \n"
"                        link below. Please navigate past the Addendums section and focus on the General \n"
"                        Regulations, Questions &amp; Expectations, and Interpretation Guidelines. For a \n"
"                        Cooler/Cooler Cold Storage operation, please note that you will need to undergo \n"
"                        audits for Module 1: Food Safety Management System, Module 5: Facility, and \n"
"                        Module 6: HACCP. Module 7: Preventive Control is optional.\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <a href=\"https://primusauditingops.com/primusgfs/\" target=\"_blank\">\n"
"                        <span>PrimusGFS Documentation</span>\n"
"                    </a>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <span>\n"
"                        For your convenience, I'm also sharing a link to our \n"
"                        <a href=\"https://intranet.primuslabs.com/Toolkit/User/Default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">\n"
"                            <span>Toolkit</span>\n"
"                        </a>, which can be a valuable resource for creating SOPs, logs, forms, and more.\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <span>\n"
"                        When you're ready to schedule either a Pre-Assessment audit or a regular audit, \n"
"                        please complete the attached application form. Additionally, please provide a \n"
"                        HACCP flow chart illustrating the product's journey from receipt at your \n"
"                        facility to its departure.\n"
"                        <br>\n"
"                        <br>\n"
"                        Lastly, I have included a quote for your reference. Should you have any\n"
"                        questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to reach out.\n"
"                        <br>\n"
"                        <br>\n"
"                        Kind regards,\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                </p> \n"
"            "
msgstr ""

